# The integration tests open this Figma design file in a signed-out browser, so anyone with the
# link must be able to view it. Copy this file to .env.local, which git ignores, and fill in a link.
# explore.e2e.mjs also needs two same-named sibling layers with children somewhere on the page.
FIGLOO_E2E_FIGMA_URL=https://www.figma.com/design/<file key>/<file name>?node-id=<page id>
